eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352240/extras/8f20f9ccc69d27f048bc6ef7bd1e1788.avif?t=1784063283\" width=780 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are in it for the long haul! We are working like crazy to bring you the best game we can - and we need your feedback to do it. <br>Balance issues, Suggestions, Feature Ideas - we wanna hear it all.<br><br> Join us on <strong>Discord</strong> and in <strong>Early Access</strong> to help us shape <strong>Raiders of Blackveil</strong> as we grow!  </p>",
